$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f2> Defend and Destroy\n<f1>Planet: <f2> Tyr's Cradle\n<f1>Weather: <f2> Snow and ice\n<f1>Time of Day: <f2> Night\n<f1>Number of Teams: <f2> 2\n\n<f1>Briefing: <f0> Both the <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> tribes have established bases on this frozen world and neither will back down. To claim this planet your tribe must destroy the enemy's communications equipment so they cannot establish contact with reinforcements.\n\nThe enemy's main command station is your primary target. It is the most important objective but it is <f2>very <f0>heavily guarded.\n\nThere are two satellite dishes atop the enemy fortress. These dishes have <f2>extremely <f0>powerful shields and taking down the enemy's power is a must to destroy them. Once these satellite dishes are destroyed they cannot be repaired.\n\nThere are also two pulse sensors you must destgroy to fully cut off the enemy's communication.\n\nGood luck!\n\n<f1>Map by: <f2>[HvC]NaTeDoGG aka Nathan Sweet\nFor use only with the HaVoC mod.\nhttp://havoc.sirris.com";
$MDESC::Type = "Defend and Destroy";
